{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Webcomic &amp; Atmospheric Sci-Fi Story</strong><br>Follow Lily and her crew on a cosmic adventure full of mysteries, strange encounters, and discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978340/extras/b75834fcac5954603f47378876291268.avif?t=1772571523\" width=1280 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Starva Saga</i></strong> is a webcomic that blends illustrated storytelling, animated sequences, and a rich sci-fi atmosphere. You play as Lily, a young Franco-Finnish woman scarred by a rocket launch trauma. To recover, she joins a psychological support program and then embarks on a daring dark-matter-powered mission with her friends. Along the journey, Lily and her crew face unexpected challenges and meet the enigmatic <strong>Princess Pum</strong>, who leads them to an unknown planet beyond our solar system , an odyssey full of mystery and emotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978340/extras/b75834fcac5954603f47378876291268.avif?t=1772571523\" width=1280 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Starva Saga ???</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character-driven narrative with slow-burn mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hybrid experience: illustrated webcomic enhanced with cinematic MP4 sequences and smooth transitions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct planetary aesthetics (Earth, Mars, Moon, Warmy) visually anchor each act.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active development with regular updates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978340/extras/b75834fcac5954603f47378876291268.avif?t=1772571523\" width=1280 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Webcomic \u00d7 Visual Novel hybrid</strong>: linear reading with cinematic moments (not a branching game).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free core story; planned paid \u201csupport edition\u201d extensions (bonus chapters to enrich the lore).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean and comfortable reading interface with smooth animations and video playback controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightweight download: approximately <strong>100 MB</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978340/extras/b75834fcac5954603f47378876291268.avif?t=1772571523\" width=1280 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">All of <strong><i>Starva Saga</i></strong> will be released on <strong>Steam</strong> once Act 1 is complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Thank you for following the project and supporting its growth!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978340?t=1772571523","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978340/17633f39517d2e2f7c587585ba73aad7dd94a22b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772571523","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978340/9b510aec9eeda11924fa0deedcec107be7417259/caps